sequenceDiagram
    participant E as TextLayoutEngine.BuildItems
    participant R as BidiRuns
    participant A as BidiAlgorithm
    participant D as BidiData
    E->>R: GetLogicalRuns(text, start, length, settings.BaseDirection, _bidiRuns)
    R->>R: decode UTF-16 to codepoints (t_cps) and offsets (t_cpStarts), ThreadStatic scratch
    R->>A: Resolve(cps, paragraphDirection, levels, removed, visualOrder)
    A->>D: GetClass(cp) for every codepoint
    A->>A: P2/P3 paragraph level (AutoDirection = 2 means first strong)
    alt no R, AL, AN, BN or explicit controls and paragraph is LTR
        A-->>R: all levels 0, nothing removed (fast path, no allocation)
    else
        A->>A: X1-X8 explicit embeddings/isolates (stack, MaxDepth 125)
        A->>A: X9 removed[] for LRE RLE LRO RLO PDF BN - X10 isolating run sequences
        loop each sequence
            A->>A: W1-W7 weak types
            A->>D: TryGetBracket / CanonicalBracket (N0, BD16)
            A->>A: N1-N2 neutrals, I1-I2 implicit levels
        end
        A->>A: L1 trailing whitespace to paragraph level - L2 reverse by level into visualOrder
        A-->>R: paragraph level
    end
    R->>R: removed codepoints inherit previous level (no holes in coverage)
    R->>R: group equal-level neighbours into Run{Start, Length, Level} in logical order
    R-->>E: paragraph level - _bidiRuns filled
    E->>E: per run: split further by font, style, presentation, orientation
